      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "欸......？这样就......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_hesitant_2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "camera_focus_unit",
            "data": {
              "id": "avatar_aglina_after",
              "offset": {
                "x": 0.310000002,
                "y": 0.529999971,
                "z": 0
              },
              "distance": 6,
              "duration": 3,
              "ease": "Linear"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "噗，安洁莉娜，是不是以为我会好好教训他一顿，再大闹一场好好倾诉自己的委屈？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "不是啦......其实是的啦。您先生的逃避使您独自面对许多困难，我以为您总会有不舒服的情绪。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_embarrassed_smile",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "其实，我会驾驶移动采矿平台哦。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "欸？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_hesitant",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "而且，从探矿到钻井知识我都懂一点。这样，无论伴侣在不在，我都能靠自己在雷姆必拓生存下去。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "换一种工作也是一样的。想要在这片土地上生存，家人的支持固然重要，但我想成为的，是那个支持家庭的支柱。这样想，是不是他的逃避就变得好接受多了？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "npc_002_agoldw",
              "animationName": "Talk",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "当然，他能躲过挨骂也是因为这段时间我总会发现，一些被莫名其妙偷偷清理过的水池、清洗过的工具、倒掉的垃圾......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "原来是这样。看来刚才我对麦尼尔先生也太严格了。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_smile",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "我还在想您说的，成为大家的支柱......嗯，我觉得您说得特别在理。这也是我的奋斗目标。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_thinking_openmouth",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "你们小小年纪就成功穿越了荒野，这可不是一般人能做到的。老太太我很看好你们哦！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "npc_002_agoldw",
              "animationName": "Talk",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "对了，这是你们的免费体验券。今天就什么也别想了，在我这里畅吃、畅玩，所有费用我包了！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
